<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Embedding trajectories of the five Gaussian cluster centers. Opacity increases over training, showing how different methods progressively separate the clusters in embedding space.</figcaption>
</figure>
